fix(ci): resolve peer-deps and add lint/format to the pipeline

- Add .npmrc with legacy-peer-deps=true. typescript-eslint 8 requires
  TypeScript <6.1, while the project builds with TypeScript 7; a clean
  "npm install" (what CI runs) failed with ERESOLVE and broke the v2.21.0
  pipelines. The linter still runs against the TS 6 API via
  scripts/eslint-ts6.mjs.
- Pin @eslint/js to ^9 to match eslint ^9 (^10 required eslint 10).
- test.yml: run npm run lint and npm run format:check.
- Isolate the "loadConfig without files" test in a temp cwd so a local
  .zamesrc.json cannot leak into the defaults check.
